<Docs title="Connect Grok — Botpasses" crumbs={[{ href: "/docs", label: "Docs" }, { href: "/docs/connect/grok", label: "Grok" }]}>
  <h1>Connect Grok</h1>
  <p>Issue a Grok Bot token from the console, or connect Grok as an MCP client to this origin. After the connector is on, ask for the task in plain language. Grok should call the API in the same turn. You approve in the inbox if asked.</p>
  <p>Do not paste an operator token or a third-party JWT into Grok.</p>
  <p>Tool contract: <a href="/docs/reference/mcp-tools">MCP tools</a>. Issue the model Bearer from the console or via <a href="/docs/reference/http-api">POST /api/clients/model</a>.</p>
</Docs>
